Dear Paul Schreuder,

Regarding the discriminant validity: I cannot really give you a definitive answer, but I have seen this used in such a way even with suboptimal fit (e.g., https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/3449218). In any case, I would explore why the fit is bad (check residual covariance or modification indices) and decide based on that if such an analysis is acceptable.

Regards,
Jošt

